&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CDL A Local Driver — Framingham&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Average Weekly Pay: $1,700 - $1,950 + Bonus Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home Daily:&lt;/strong&gt; Home after every route&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Call a Recruiter Directly: 888-959-6357&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Car-Hauling Experience? No Problem.&lt;/strong&gt; We provide fully paid, top-tier training to safely load and operate our 9-car haulers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Drive with Carvana?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Daily: Spend your time where it matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO: 144 hours (nearly 4 weeks!) of PTO in your first year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Predictable Schedules: Quarterly Schedules &amp;amp; Pay Differentials - Earn more with night route pay differentials and enjoy the flexibility of our quarterly shift bid process - opportunity to change your schedule to fit your life!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Option for 100% Company-Paid Medical Insurance (plus great Family &amp;amp; Pet benefits).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern Fleet:&amp;nbsp; Drive well-maintained, late-model trucks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks You’ll Actually Use:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with Carvana Match&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts on vehicle purchases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid mobile phone and plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First things first. As a Vehicle Transporter, you’ll be home daily. When you’re working, you’ll be moving cars between our production facilities and delivery hubs for the safe and timely delivery of our customer cars. We offer competitive pay with our pay per mile compensation structure, along with plenty of opportunities for additional ways to earn even more. Bonus opportunities include night route differential, quarterly bonus opportunities, extra day pay, and more!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;Valid CDL driver&#39;s license with Med Card&lt;br&gt;Must be at least 21 years of age&lt;br&gt;Ability to read, write, and speak English&lt;br&gt;6 months of tractor trailer in last 3 years or equivalent Military experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain courteous and professional behavior &amp;amp; appearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loading and securing vehicles on our 9 car haulers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Following all safety procedures and maintaining driver log&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transporting vehicles between Carvana locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must adhere to the delivery schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a clean driving record and Class A CDL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the safe and timely delivery of our customer cars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with transportation team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Other requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be able to do your job at Carvana, there are some basic requirements we want to share with you. This job position is designated as a safety sensitive position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to walk 75’ and climb a 10’ ladder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to bend, kneel, twist, squat, stand and climb as required to secure load&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires standing, stretching, walking, stooping, pushing and/or pulling in an outdoor environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires excellent visual acuity and manual dexterity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires use of safety equipment that may include non-slip shoes, gloves, and other protective garments and equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires frequent driving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is not eligible for visa sponsorship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
