&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entry-Level roles:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Detailing, Inventory Associate (Car Porters), Photo, Parts Associate, Inspection, and Coordinator/Administrator roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to physically operate vehicle equipment and tools - must be able to lift up to 60 pounds independently&lt;/li&gt;
