&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for Airbrush Technicians with a &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;minimum of 1 year&lt;/span&gt; of professional automotive painting experience &lt;/strong&gt;to join us at Carvana - the fastest-growing used automotive retailer in U.S. history and one of the four fastest companies to make the Fortune 500.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an Airbrush Technician, you’ll be expected to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;color-match, mix paint, and airbrush vehicles.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Carvana, you’ll receive a &lt;strong&gt;competitive wage and amazing perks – including a 401(k) with Carvana match and even a vehicle purchase discount &lt;/strong&gt;– all while using state of the art tools in one of our high-tech Inspection Centers (&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.carvana.com/careers/dept/inspection-centers&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to learn more). If you’re joining us in an entry-level position, we offer training programs to make sure your skills and pay progress along with the company.&lt;/p&gt;
