&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All applicants must pass a drug test and obtain a DOT Medical Card. &lt;/em&gt;This role is not eligible for visa sponsorship. Must be at least 21 years of age and possess a valid driver&#39;s license. Must be able to read, write, speak, and understand English.”&lt;/p&gt;

