&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Carvana&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carvana, we sell cars but we aren&#39;t car salesmen. Our promise is simple: we won&#39;t sell a car to a customer that we wouldn&#39;t sell to our own Mom. Period.&amp;nbsp;Being a brand ambassador at Carvana means having a passion for our vision and having a motor that never quits when it comes to representing our brand and values. Our Market Operations team members work as a team to deliver awesome customer experiences in their markets, while also remaining agile enough to keep up with the ever-changing beat and cadence of your daily activities.&amp;nbsp;Think you&#39;ve got what it takes to join our team? Apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
