&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else?&lt;/strong&gt; Scheduling and shift options (such as 4x10 schedules) are determined by business need.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
