&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Review customer paperwork for accuracy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Interacting with state and county government licensing departments, requiring in-person and online document drop-off and pick-up, and receiving and filing paperwork with said agencies..Work closely with the local DMV; picking up, receiving and filing paperwork from the DMV.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
