&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Carvana Diesel Technician: Join Our Fleet Maintenance Team!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our rapidly growing team at Carvana, where we&#39;re revolutionizing the car buying experience! We&#39;re seeking a skilled and dedicated&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Diesel Technician&lt;/strong&gt; to join our innovative Fleet Maintenance team. If you’re a problem-solver who enjoys working on &lt;strong&gt;Class 8 trucks and trailers&lt;/strong&gt; and is passionate about vehicle uptime, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
