&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Apply Carvana lean manufacturing principles and follow standardized work by adhering to the &lt;/span&gt;5S model.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
