&lt;li&gt;Have the knowledge of being able to remove and install (R&amp;amp;I) various parts of the vehicle including but not limited to headliners, taillights, headlights, liftgates, door panels, etc. as well as understanding panel access points.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow NAAA guidelines as it pertains to the repair method of each vehicle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires &lt;strong&gt;frequent national travel, up to 75 %&lt;/strong&gt;, as you&#39;ll deploy from your home base to collaborate with and support other Inspection Centers within the company nationwide in supporting production target needs. During non-travel weeks, you&#39;ll contribute directly to the success of your &lt;strong&gt;home Inspection Center&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
