&lt;li&gt;Assist in the development and management of information systems related to recordkeeping for EHS management and compliance programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the ongoing compliance with multimedia environmental permits and regulatory requirements across a regional operating area or specific site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with outside consultants as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor programs and performance to track compliance and effectiveness of all EHS initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate with Safety Action Teams (SATs) across operating locations in the assigned region or site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review management tools and measurement systems to facilitate compliance and the ability to satisfy regulatory scrutiny.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly interface with OSHA and Environmental regulators on the company’s behalf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with properties regarding corrective actions and/or alleged violations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing support for regulatory questions across numerous jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review development plans for compliance and permitting concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead environmental due diligence efforts as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other tasks related to environmental affairs and health and safety as assigned by team leadership.’&lt;/li&gt;
