&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carvana, we sell cars but we aren’t car salesmen.&amp;nbsp; Our promise is simple: we won’t sell a car to a customer that we wouldn’t sell to our own Mom. Period. To make sure our car’s are in first-rate condition,&amp;nbsp; we’ve built multiple vehicle Reconditioning Centers around the country, where our cars are inspected, perfected, and photographed before reaching the Carvana website. Using our Carvana Certified 150-point inspection process, we’re able to verify that every vehicle meets our rigorous mechanical and cosmetic standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to provide only the highest quality vehicles to our customers in our mission to deliver a no-hassle, better car buying experience. We are actively looking for passionate and talented individuals who can help us deliver on that promise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think you’ve got what it takes to join our team? Keep reading below to see what we’re looking for!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team and position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Inspection Center General Manager is responsible for the overall performance of the center. Providing leadership for up to 500 associates working multiple shifts in a lean manufacturing environment. Maintaining a culture of continuous improvement and high associate engagement while ensuring the facility meets quality, production, and cost objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership 30%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads strategic planning to ensure the facility will have the capability to meet future demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides strategic vision and guidance to the location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures management beliefs and behaviors are in line with the Carvana culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent visits to the shop floor to ensure connection with the realities of the business and model leadership behaviors throughout the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positively challenge and engage the team to continuously improve quality production and cost performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live the Carvana values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Production Management 30%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead production planning for the Inspection Center&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Inspection Center has adequate capacity to meet production targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee weekly performance review meetings for each area and report out on the Inspection Centers performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify problems impacting the Inspection Center’s performance. Prioritize problems, allocate resources, and ensure the resolution of issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure operating standards such as standardized work, operating rules, 5S, and visual management tools are consistently executed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with all health and safety and loss prevention guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People Management 30%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the selection and hiring process, ensure a pipeline of associates to fill current and future positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a bench of candidates for each leadership position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure progression path training and certification process is consistently executed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model effective teamwork and ensure it’s embraced at all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide competency-based feedback and ensure leaders throughout the organization are also providing appropriate feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor reconditioning managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuous Improvement 10%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the selection of continuous improve events, allocate resources to support events, and hold the team accountable for results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in and lead continuous improvement efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and mentor reconditioning managers on problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 8 years of management experience either in automotive or a lean manufacturing environment leading multiple work groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A valid driver’s license&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid unrestricted driver’s license with a clean driving record in the last 3 years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of lean manufacturing principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading and developing associates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to obtain project deliverables and company metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work a flexible work schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to work in a fast-paced, ever-changing production environment while sometimes being exposed to excessive weather conditions (heat/cold)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communications skills, oral and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with and through teams to achieve results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analysis and decision making ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient computer skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’ll offer in return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-Time Position with a competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401K with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A multitude of perks including student loan payments, discounts on vehicles, benefits for your pets, and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great wellness program to keep you healthy and happy, both physically and mentally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to opportunities to expand your skillset and share your knowledge with others across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture of promotions from within, with a start-up atmosphere allowing for varied and rapid career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A seat in one of the fastest-growing companies in the country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
