&lt;li&gt;Note:&amp;nbsp; Refer to the Handbook and Policy Manuals for important addendum requirements to all job descriptions.&amp;nbsp; This job description in no way states or implies that these are the only duties to be performed by the employee(s) incumbent in this position.&amp;nbsp; Employee(s) will be required to follow any other job-related instructions and to perform any other job-related duties requested by any person authorized to give instructions or assignments. The requirements listed in this document are the minimum levels of knowledge, skills, or abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
