&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visual acuity requirements include color, depth perception and field of vision comparable to definitions for &lt;strong&gt;Mobile Equipment Operator Standard&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as, Clerical, Administrative, Machine Operators (including inspection) positions.&lt;/li&gt;
