&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting to the Operations Manager or other designated manager, you will operate motor vehicles on the premises in support of auction activities. Your primary focus is to execute vehicle movement across the lot by transporting and staging units in designated areas under the direction of leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
