&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team and position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a skilled and self-motivated Mobile Heavy Duty Diesel Mechanic or Mobile Heavy Duty Diesel Technician to join our growing team. In this role, you&#39;ll be responsible for diagnosing, repairing, and maintaining a variety of diesel engines and heavy equipment at Carvana locations. If you&#39;re passionate about diesel technology, thrive on variety, and enjoy providing top-notch service, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re proud to offer our team members a supportive, collaborative environment and outstanding benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Pay &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive hourly compensation and overtime opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matching 401k&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO:&lt;/strong&gt; Accrue 104 hours in your first year!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool Allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a &lt;strong&gt;$500 annual tool allowance&lt;/strong&gt; to keep your equipment up-to-date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boot Allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Get a &lt;strong&gt;$100 boot allowance&lt;/strong&gt; every 6 months to ensure you have the right gear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investments in Your Future:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ASE certification reimbursement&lt;/strong&gt; (we cover the cost!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tuition reimbursement and student loan repayment programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal training, including classroom time for DTNA ARC Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Carvana employee discount&lt;/strong&gt; on vehicle purchases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet benefits and much more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to designated locations to perform mobile diagnostics, troubleshooting, and repairs on diesel trucks, trailers, heavy equipment, and other diesel-powered machinery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing Fleet Maintenance services for our ever-growing fleet of car-hauling equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and repair issues related to engines, transmissions, electrical systems, hydraulic systems, brakes, and other components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct preventative maintenance, electrical/ mechanical diagnostics, and mechanical repair.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize diagnostic software and tools to identify and resolve complex mechanical and electrical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate service records, documenting all repairs, parts used, and hours worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively to explain repairs, provide estimates, and ensure satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and maintain a clean and organized service vehicle, ensuring all necessary tools and parts are stocked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to all safety regulations and company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide exceptional service and represent the company professionally at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our top technicians have extensive knowledge in both Electrical and Mechanical Diagnostics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preventative Maintenance is a priority, but the ideal candidate should be knowledgeable and proficient in troubleshooting and repair of: HVAC, Braking systems and wheel end components, Engine systems, Emissions and Aftertreatment, and Electrical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a mobile technician; travel is required 100% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or GED required; associate&#39;s degree or certificate in diesel technology, heavy equipment repair, or a related field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience as a diesel technician, preferably with mobile service experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of diesel engine systems, hydraulics, electrical systems, and diagnostics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with diagnostic software and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid driver&#39;s license with a clean driving record&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and manage time effectively in a mobile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and critical-thinking skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift heavy objects and perform physically demanding tasks in various weather conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parts and Service management with TMT and TMW&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DiagnosticLINK for DD13 motor diagnostics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ToolBox for Wabco Air systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service Ranger for Eaton Transmission Diagnostics tools like JPRO or other universal or band specific equipment for electrical diagnostics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be great if you also had&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be able to do your job at Carvana, there are some basic requirements we want to share with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to read, write, speak and understand English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
