&lt;li&gt;Schedule: We offer two shifts at this location. Please keep in mind that all locations are subject to mandatory overtime based on business need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First shift: Mon-Fri 6am-3pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Second shift: Mon-Thurs 4pm-3am&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Our inspection center is located at: 6161 Middle Ridge Rd, Lorain, OH 44053&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
