&lt;li&gt;Must promote the company culture and mission to all employees, vendors, clients, and business partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speaks clearly and persuasively in positive or negative situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be proficient in MS Office and Adobe, and comfortable learning new project management/reporting platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
