&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring for &lt;strong&gt;entry-level automotive roles &lt;/strong&gt;at Carvana - the fastest-growing used automotive retailer in U.S. history and one of the four fastest companies to make the Fortune 500.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In these entry-level roles, you’ll have several positions to choose from:&lt;/p&gt;
