&lt;li&gt;Photograph and stage vehicles to ensure focused and clear pictures per standards.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Return customer’s vehicles in clean condition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run inventory reports for the detail shop.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise the designated Manager of all equipment breakdowns and required maintenance immediately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any other duties assigned by the designated manager&lt;/li&gt;
