&lt;p&gt;Training (approximately 2-4 weeks) will be paid at the full-time hourly rate! To best set you up for success, we are unable to grant time off during the training period. You will be required to demonstrate proficiency to graduate from training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carvana, we thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic, and ever-changing environment. This is a full-time, hourly position with work hours that may fluctuate based on business needs.Our operational hours cover Monday through Sunday, 6am - 6pm. Because your shift could include early mornings, evenings, or required weekend days, open schedule availability is required. All shifts provide two consecutive days off. We have bi-annual performance based shift bids where your schedule may change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Options:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer two primary shift schedules:&lt;/p&gt;
