&lt;li&gt;401(k) retirement plan with Carvana matching contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overtime opportunities based on business need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan and Carvana Shares annual grant program, allowing you to become a Carvana shareholder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% company-paid healthcare premiums for comprehensive medical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental and vision benefits to care for your overall health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness programs focused on supporting your mental, physical, and financial health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet care savings program because we know your furry friends are family too!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time off starting with 13 days in your first year, increasing to 20 days in year two and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;9 company-paid holidays, including your birthday, because we celebrate you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Training (approximately 2-4 weeks) will be paid at the full-time hourly rate! To best set you up for success, we are unable to grant time off during the training period. You will be required to demonstrate proficiency to graduate from training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carvana, we thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic, and ever-changing environment. This is a full-time, hourly position with work hours that may fluctuate based on business needs.Our operational hours cover Monday through Sunday, 6am - 6pm. Because your shift could include early mornings, evenings, or required weekend days, open schedule availability is required. All shifts provide two consecutive days off. We have bi-annual performance based shift bids where your schedule may change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Options:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer two primary shift schedules:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5x8: &lt;/strong&gt;Five days a week, eight hours per day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4x10: &lt;/strong&gt;Four days a week, ten hours per day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Overtime may be required during peak periods such as tax season.&lt;/p&gt;
