&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Auto Body roles: &lt;/strong&gt;Paint, Prep/Body work, Wheel Repair, Airbrush, Interior Repair, Glass Repair, and PDR (Paintless Dent Repair) roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Auto Technician/Mechanic roles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Lube and Oil, Inspection, Brake and Tire, Mechanical Repair / Build, and Master Technician roles&lt;/li&gt;
