&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Carvana&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carvana, we believe buying a car the old-fashioned way sucks — so we&#39;re rewriting the playbook. Yes, we&#39;re the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FnHaPVP-opw&quot;&gt;vending machine&lt;/a&gt; people. Yes, we built that on purpose. And yes, we&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who want to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;thrive&lt;/em&gt; in an environment of impactful change. Team spirit shows up in everything we do — every day, our passion and creativity drive the kind of innovation that moves an industry. We take big swings, set ambitious goals, and challenge each other to make data- and process-driven decisions in everything we do. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=93pa9NmlrYc&quot;&gt;Here are a few of our stories.&lt;/a&gt; We&#39;ve been changing the game since 2013, and we&#39;re not letting up. Want the full story? &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c5dpBRp0-_w&quot;&gt;Check it out here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team and position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Safe &amp;amp; Secure team is the heartbeat of every Carvana location. You&#39;re the people we trust to protect our associates, our customers, and the thousands of vehicles that flow through our gates every day. Rain, shine, ice, or 110° heat — the mission doesn&#39;t change, and neither does the standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;boots-on-the-ground&lt;/em&gt; role. We bring the strategy; you bring the hustle. From clearing snow during a winter storm to running heat-safety protocols in July, you&#39;ll be the reason our site stays open, safe, and moving. Some days you&#39;ll be at the gate — the literal face of Carvana to every associate, vendor, and visitor walking through it. Other days, you&#39;ll be out on the lot scanning vehicles, knocking out safety audits, or restocking the supplies that keep this place humming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You won&#39;t just&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;monitor&lt;/em&gt; a perimeter — you&#39;ll &lt;em&gt;own&lt;/em&gt; it. That means spotting hazards before they become incidents, building real relationships with the folks on site, and stepping up when something needs your attention. You&#39;ll be trained and trusted to act in emergencies, partner with our Inspection Center and Logistics teams, and feed sharp, accurate intel back to your Safe &amp;amp; Secure leadership. Hourly position, reporting to your Safe &amp;amp; Secure Functional Lead or Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead with a &lt;em&gt;service-first&lt;/em&gt; mindset in every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live the Carvana values — and make sure they&#39;re felt by everyone you work with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the &lt;em&gt;face of Carvana&lt;/em&gt; at the gate for associates, vendors, and visitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate like a pro — clear, calm, active listener, no missed signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use our Unified Security Platform to monitor live cameras, review footage, and investigate intrusion alerts so nothing on site catches us off guard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;When things get hot, &lt;em&gt;keep it cool&lt;/em&gt;. De-escalate, win with partners, and remember — &lt;em&gt;we&#39;re all in this together&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run point at the gate using the Safe &amp;amp; Secure App (SAS App) and RFID tech, enforcing ingress/egress procedures every single time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and document vehicle movement through the Inspection Center entrance and exit gates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show up when the team needs you. You&#39;ll be trained and certified in first aid, CPR, and AED — and we expect you to use it when the moment calls for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know our emergency protocols cold so you can act decisively when seconds count.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the site operational in &lt;em&gt;any&lt;/em&gt; weather — snow removal in winter, heat-safety protocols in summer, no excuses, no shortcuts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a &lt;em&gt;safety-first&lt;/em&gt; culture by spotting environmental hazards, running safety audits, and reinforcing best practices with the people around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scan thousands of vehicles a day to keep operational flow tight — between mobile rover tech and manual handheld scans, every car gets accounted for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cover ground. This role involves serious walking to reach restricted or hard-to-access areas of the lot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run vehicle location research and deliver clean, detailed reports to leadership when operational questions come up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
