&lt;p&gt;To be able to do your job at Carvana, there are some basic requirements we want to share with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to read, write, speak, and understand English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to walk/stand and sustain physical activity for extended periods of time (8+ hours).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to stay in stationary positions for extended periods of time (when driving) up to 3 hours at a time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequently communicates with customers and must be able to exchange accurate information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
