&lt;li&gt;Facilitate new hire orientation &amp;amp; maintain site rosters and schedules&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and execute communication plans for key operations initiatives or events&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle, coordinate and oversee onsite engagement events via email, business updates, and announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with leadership teams, internal stakeholders, vendors, and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist onsite vendors with directions/access while on site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coordinate and provide oversight for employee engagement events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
