&lt;li&gt;Must be at least 18 years of age&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have a valid driver&#39;s license&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clean driving record with no more than two moving violations or DUI’s in the last three years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The physical environment requires the employee to work both inside and outside in heat/cold, wet/humid, and dry/arid conditions&lt;/li&gt;
