&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability to manage, organize, and reconcile multiple sources of information with accuracy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability to diagnose, prioritize, and solve problems with varying complexity while maintaining a focus on team engagement and customer relations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
