&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% company-paid healthcare premiums for comprehensive medical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental and vision benefits to care for your overall health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness programs focused on supporting your mental, physical, and financial health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet care savings program because we know your furry friends are family too!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time off starting with 13 days in your first year, increasing to 20 days in year two and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;9 company-paid holidays, including your birthday, because we celebrate you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And more!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
