&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Carvana&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carvana, we sell cars, but we’re not salespeople. Since 2013, we’ve been making it our mission to change the way people buy cars. We saw a huge problem with how much it can suck to buy a car the traditional way, so we committed ourselves to tackling one of the largest, yet-to-be-disrupted markets in the world – the $1T per year U.S. car market (yes, that’s $Trillion with a “T”).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With the ability to search thousands of vehicles from our expansive inventory, to high-resolution 360° photographs of our vehicles’ interior and exterior, to real-time financing and the ability to complete contracts without visiting the back room of a dealership, we provide a seamless, online car buying experience for consumers that can be completed from their desktop or mobile device. All our vehicles are inspected and reconditioned based on our 150-point certification checklist and come with a 7-day return policy. We also operate our own logistics network to deliver cars to customers as soon as the next day, as well as offer customer pick-up at our state-of-the-art Car Vending Machine locations (yes, you read that right). By putting customer satisfaction at the core of our business, we’ve built a no-pressure, no-haggle online car buying experience that saves our customers time and money.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on Carvana, take a look at our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6-afpVx9fRU&quot;&gt;company introduction video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team and position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr. Specialist Warranty is responsible for the oversight, administration, and optimization of all warranty claims and recovery processes for a large-scale Class 8, Class 6, and Class 5 tractor and trailer fleet. This includes managing relationships with OEMs (e.g., Freightliner, Isuzu, Cummins), ensuring shop compliance with filing procedures, and identifying &quot;hidden&quot; recovery opportunities like policy adjustments and campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr. Specialist Warranty is an individual contributor role based at Tempe headquarters, reporting directly to the Associate Director Vendor and Asset Operations. This role will work a traditional Monday - Friday business hours schedule (typically 8-5).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Claim Lifecycle Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the submission, tracking, and reconciliation of all warranty claims to ensure maximum recovery of parts and labor costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OEM &amp;amp; Dealer Relations:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary point of contact for manufacturers and dealerships; negotiate &quot;policy&quot; or &quot;goodwill&quot; coverage for failures occurring just outside of standard warranty terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Auditing:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform regular audits of internal repair orders to ensure technicians and service writers are documenting &quot;three Cs&quot; (Complaint, Cause, and Correction) required for successful filings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor failure trends across the fleet to identify recurring component issues. Provide data to the Procurement team to influence future equipment specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Track monthly recovery targets and provide leadership with visibility into &quot;dollars-per-unit&quot; recovered and pending credits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign &amp;amp; Recall Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor completion rates for safety recalls and manufacturer service bulletins across multiple regions/terminals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years in heavy-duty trucking maintenance, specifically focused on Class 8, Class 6, and Class 5 equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of VMRS (Vehicle Maintenance Reporting Standards) codes and major OEM portal systems (e.g., Daimler, Cummins QuickServe, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to bridge the gap between &quot;grease-under-the-fingernails&quot; shop operations and corporate financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the transportation and mechanical repair industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Warranty processing experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in G Suite (Gmail, Google Docs, Google Sheets, etc.), Excel (SQL is a plus), and has experience building forecast models and analyzing complex data sets to make impact high-impact business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’ll offer in return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401K with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A multitude of perks including student loan payments, discounts on vehicles, benefits for your pets, and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great wellness program to keep you healthy and happy both physically and mentally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to opportunities to expand your skillset and share your knowledge with others across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture of promotions from within, with a start-up atmosphere allowing for varied and rapid career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A seat in one of the fastest-growing companies in the country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be able to do your job at Carvana, there are some basic requirements we want to share with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to read, write, speak and understand English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work a flexible work schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sees the ‘big picture’ with the ability to get it done (task oriented)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy and the ability to multitask and prioritize effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills creating the ability to influence Operating units across the Carvana Network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Of course, we’ll make any reasonable accommodations for those with disabilities to perform the essential functions of their jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
